// Falchion Sedan body: a late-90s rear-drive compact sports sedan built up with a body kit.
//
// Intent: tight, low and taut. A short nose with twin lamps either side of a slim slot, a
// long hood over the rear-drive six, a tidy four-door cabin with a short, high deck and a
// lip on its edge. An aftermarket kit in the paint (a deep air dam with a splitter, side
// skirts, a valance over a dark diffuser), multi-spoke wheels, black trim. Front engine,
// rear drive. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
